<div class="row"><div><div class="eyebrow">Administrator</div><h1>Website settings</h1><p class="muted">Provider credentials are never sent to customer pages. Leave an API key blank to keep the saved key.</p></div><a class="btn secondary" href="/admin">Back to admin</a></div><div class="card"><h2>Pricing and website settings</h2><form method="post" action="/admin/settings"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%=csrf%>"><div class="field"><label>USD → NGN exchange rate</label><input type="number" name="usd_ngn_rate" min="1" max="10000000" step="0.01" value="<%=settings.usd_ngn_rate%>" required></div><div class="field"><label>Payment instructions / bank details</label><textarea name="payment_details"><%=settings.payment_details%></textarea></div><div class="field"><label>WhatsApp number</label><input name="payment_whatsapp_number" value="<%=settings.payment_whatsapp_number%>"></div><div class="field"><label>Support method</label><select name="support_method"><%['whatsapp','telegram','custom'].forEach(x=>{%><option value="<%=x%>" <%=settings.support_method===x?'selected':''%>><%=x%></option><%})%></select></div><div class="field"><label>Support URL (HTTPS)</label><input name="support_url" value="<%=settings.support_url%>"></div><div class="field"><label>Support label</label><input name="support_label" value="<%=settings.support_label%>" maxlength="60"></div><div class="field"><label>Support shortcut</label><select name="support_enabled"><option value="1" <%=settings.support_enabled!=='0'?'selected':''%>>Enabled</option><option value="0" <%=settings.support_enabled==='0'?'selected':''%>>Disabled</option></select></div><%[['grizzly','GrizzlySMS'],['nova','NovaSolution'],['smm','Really Simple Social'],['sl','Rakib Socials']].forEach(([k,label])=>{%><div style="border-top:1px solid #e4e8f2;margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px"><h3><%=label%></h3><div class="field"><label>API URL (HTTPS)</label><input name="<%=k%>_api_url" value="<%=settings[k+'_api_url']%>" required></div><div class="field"><label>API key</label><input type="password" name="<%=k%>_api_key" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="<%=settings[k+'_has_key']?'Saved — enter a new key to rotate':'Not configured — enter API key'%>"></div></div><%})%><button class="btn">Save settings</button></form></div><div class="cards" style="margin-top:18px"><%[['grizzly','GrizzlySMS'],['nova','NovaSolution'],['smm','Really Simple Social'],['sl','Rakib Socials']].forEach(([k,label])=>{%><div class="card"><h3><%=label%></h3><p class="muted"><%=settings[k+'_has_key']?'API key configured':'API key not configured'%></p><p class="muted"><%=settings['health_'+k]||'Not tested yet'%></p><p><strong>Last balance response</strong><br><small class="muted"><%=settings['provider_balance_'+k]||'Not checked yet'%></small></p><form method="post" action="/admin/providers/<%=k%>/test"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%=csrf%>"><button class="btn secondary" style="width:100%">Test balance/read endpoint</button></form><form method="post" action="/admin/providers/<%=k%>/sync" style="margin-top:10px"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%=csrf%>"><button class="btn" style="width:100%">Sync catalogue</button></form></div><%})%></div><p class="muted" style="font-size:12px">Connection tests are read-only and do not prove paid orders, cancellation, OTP polling or refunds. Verify catalogue units and set customer-facing NGN prices before any sales.</p>
